Recently we insert some records into cfProductPrfx, which defines what Contract Prefix should be used when generate a new contract num

this is the stored procedure being used to generate contractnum

CREATE PROCEDURE [dbo].[DPP_GenContractNumber] @psProductId		CHAR(2)
                                             , @psContractType	VARCHAR(2)
											            , @psDealerId		VARCHAR(8)
											            , @psLienHolderId	VARCHAR(2)
											            , @psProgramId      VARCHAR(5) = NULL
											            , @psGPProgramId    VARCHAR(5) = NULL
                                             , @psNum		    CHAR(12) OUTPUT
                                             , @psLang		    CHAR(1)	= 'E'
                                             , @psUserId		    VARCHAR(12)

